.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH list 1  "list " 
.SH NAME
list \- List your cloud snippets (or your stars with \-\-stars)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlist\fR [\fB\-\-stars\fR] [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List your cloud snippets (or your stars with \-\-stars)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-stars\fR
List snippets you have starred instead
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
